# RemoteAgentFramework .gitignore
# Educational cybersecurity simulation project

# ==========================================
# SECURITY: Never commit real data
# ==========================================

# Real browser data (if accidentally present)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
Cookies
cookies.sqlite
cookies.txt
Local State
Login Data
Web Data

